{
  "_comment": "The order jkOS Alpha's home draws the HUD's cards in: the person's saved arrangement, as the web draws it on a phone (the mobile tier, read top to bottom, left to right). check:native runs every case through ORDECK's real loadHudState and layoutForBreakpoint (apps/ordeck/scripts/hud-graph.mjs); the JVM test runs the same file through HudOrder.kt. `preferences` is the profile's preferences blob; `expect` is the card ids in order.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "nothing saved: the default arrangement",
      "preferences": {},
      "expect": [
        "clock",
        "today",
        "systems",
        "weather",
        "notifications",
        "calendar"
      ]
    },
